<title>UK: LME details stock report change for Christmas week.</title>
<headline>LME details stock report change for Christmas week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said that it will not publish warehouse stock movements on Friday December 27, as the market will be closed on December 26.</p>
<p>&quot;Stocks will be published on Tuesday December 31 1996, and routinely thereafter twice weekly as usual,&quot; it said in a notice to members. --London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8080</p>
